  "summary": "Customer exercises option under previously announced prime contractor agreement, indicating confidence in Maris-Tech’s execution and supporting its role in critical ground force systems. Rehovot, Israel, Aug. 11, 2026 — Maris-Tech Ltd. (Nasdaq: MTEK, MTEKW) (“Maris-Tech” or the “Company”), a global leader in edge computing, AI, and video intelligence solutions for defense applications, today announced that […] The post Maris-Tech Receives Contract Expansion for Government Defense Program appeared first on MARIS - TECH .",
